  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This spectacular newly renovated three-story home offers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and location. Ideally situated on the boardwalk and just a one-minute walk to the private beach and town center, this one-of-a-kind retreat is designed for memorable gatherings with family and friends while comfortably accommodating up to 14 guests. NEW PICTURES COMING SOON!!! <br><br>The expansive open-concept main living area seamlessly combines the living, dining, and kitchen spaces, creating a bright and welcoming environment for entertaining. The newly redesigned chef’s kitchen features premium appliances including a Sub-Zero refrigerator/freezer, six-burner Wolf gas range and oven, Cove dishwasher, Taj Mahal quartzite countertops, and custom white oak cabinetry. An abundance of windows fills the space with natural light. The dining table seats ten guests, with additional seating for five at the kitchen island.<br><br>The inviting living room features newly selected designer furnishings with comfortable seating for everyone to gather, relax, and enjoy time together.<br><br>The first floor includes a queen bedroom with a beautifully redesigned bath featuring a tub/shower combination and quartz vanity. A stylish powder room showcases floor-to-ceiling textured tile, a floating granite vanity, and a wall-mounted brass faucet.<br><br>Three of the four bedrooms are located on the second floor and feature king beds with newly renovated private baths, quartz vanities, and dual shower systems. One bedroom also offers a private balcony with seating for two and lovely ocean views.<br><br>The third floor provides an exceptional space for families and larger groups. This level features a spacious lounge area, kitchenette, table seating, and a large-screen TV. The highlight is the expansive outdoor balcony offering beautiful ocean views. A separate bunk area includes four beds (two full and two twin) along with a full bath with walk-in shower, creating a comfortable fifth sleeping space.<br><br>Additional amenities include a rare four-car private parking area.<br><br>With its prime location, stunning renovation, and thoughtfully designed spaces, this home offers the perfect setting for an unforgettable 30A getaway.<br><br>Our team at The All Seasons Collection 30A looks forward to welcoming you.<br><br>Kindly note that wedding groups are not preferred.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
